  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire et nutritionnelle d&#x2019;urgence dans les r&#xe9;gions du centre et du nord du Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide critical food and nutrition assistance to vulnerable communities affected by conflict-related displacement in Mali. This WFP project provides lifesaving food assistance, cash transfers and nutrition interventions for acutely malnourished women, men and children. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 44,198 people, including 5,503 men, 15,378 women, 17,000 children, and 3,614 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
